**Read:** [Non-ferrous Extractive Metallurgy — Ray and Pugazhenthy, NPTEL](../sources/Nonferrous-Extractive-Metallurgy-NPTEL.lingua#r_29G1ZF58Y8EG123MNX3ZRNRE2W), the complete physical-refining and selected metal cases; [Materials Processing — Chris Schuh, MIT 3.044](../sources/Materials-Processing-MIT-3-044.lingua#r_4V5BA7W1TFKGRTGNHN7ZTAK1TW), the full zone-refining and finite-diffusion sequence; [Non-ferrous Metals Industries — European Commission BREF](../sources/Nonferrous-Metals-Industries-BREF.lingua#r_19ZD7KKDWVWM20MXVNCQZJMCDB), whole applicable refining, analytical, and product-quality accounts.

Distillation, segregation, zone-based purification, filtration/separation, and other physical refining methods exploit defined phase/physical differences. Volatility, partition, phase stability, transport, kinetics, and the actual impurity species determine their limits. A process label is not a universal path to arbitrarily pure metal.

Use the earlier partition/solidification accounts to distinguish equilibrium and effective distribution, finite diffusion, mixing, moved interfaces, and end effects. Multiple passes or stages change inventories and gradients; they do not automatically remove an impurity whose behavior or contamination source is unfavorable.

High-purity work connects feed, containment, atmosphere/vacuum, reagents/consumables, transfer, surfaces, cleaning, sampling, and trace analysis. A nominal many-nines purity claim must identify which constituents were measured, their basis/limits, and the supporting uncertainty. The later semiconductor/feedstock trails deepen their unique purity, structure, and manufacturing requirements.

**Work:** reconstruct a complete physical-refining/high-purity study with its exact method, impurity models, and measurements. Independently derive a phase/solute or volatility balance and check a limiting case. Compare predicted redistribution with independent spatial/trace evidence and an alternative contamination explanation. Defend a subsequent handling/material step based on actual purity and structure requirements rather than assuming the refining label establishes fitness for use.

**Continue:** [Derive metal-forming models with the actual stress, strain, rate, and material state](../forming/Stress-strain-yield-flow-and-deformation-history.lingua#r_5Y6ANG20ZFEX2WTRJKCQR4EM4J).

